### CREATE ESCROW ORDER
POST {{base_url}}/escrows/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Instagram preorder sneaker",
  "description": "Buyer pays into escrow before dispatch",
  "amount_kobo": 150000,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "sales_channel": "INSTAGRAM",
  "delivery_mode": "PHYSICAL",
