}

### LIST ESCROW ORDERS
GET {{base_url}}/escrows/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### GET ESCROW ORDER
GET {{base_url}}/escrows/orders/{{escrow_reference}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### GET PUBLIC ESCROW ORDER
GET {{base_url}}/public/escrows/orders/{{escrow_reference}}

### INITIATE ESCROW CHECKOUT WITH KORA
POST {{base_url}}/escrows/orders/{{escrow_reference}}/checkout/kora
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "redirect_url": "https://escra.app/checkout/return",
  "notification_url": "https://your-public-api.example.com/api/v1/webhooks/kora",
  "channels": ["bank_transfer", "card"],
  "default_channel": "bank_transfer",
  "merchant_bears_cost": true
}

