{}

### REFUND ESCROW ORDER
POST {{base_url}}/escrows/orders/{{escrow_reference}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Seller approved refund after dispute"
}

### ADMIN RESOLVE DISPUTE - RELEASE
POST {{base_url}}/admin/escrows/orders/{{escrow_reference}}/resolve-dispute
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "RELEASE",
  "resolution_note": "Admin reviewed evidence and released seller payout"
}

### ADMIN RESOLVE DISPUTE - REFUND
POST {{base_url}}/admin/escrows/orders/{{escrow_reference}}/resolve-dispute
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "REFUND",
  "resolution_note": "Admin reviewed evidence and refunded buyer"
}

### ADMIN KORA REFUND TO ORIGINAL PAYMENT
POST {{base_url}}/admin/providers/kora/refunds
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_reference": "{{payment_reference}}",
